     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-middle-eastern-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-middle-eastern-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-middle-eastern-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2120-4</td><td>Egyptian</td></tr><tr><td>2122-0</td><td>Iraqi</td></tr><tr><td>2121-2</td><td>Iranian</td></tr><tr><td>2127-9</td><td>Israeli</td></tr><tr><td>2123-8</td><td>Lebanese</td></tr><tr><td>2124-6</td><td>Palestinian</td></tr><tr><td>2125-3</td><td>Syrian</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-background-codes</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>9999-13</td><td>Emirati</td></tr><tr><td>9999-14</td><td>Jewish: Mizrahi</td></tr><tr><td>9999-15</td><td>Jordanian</td></tr><tr><td>9999-16</td><td>Kurdish</td></tr><tr><td>9999-17</td><td>Kuwaiti</td></tr><tr><td>9999-18</td><td>Libyan</td></tr><tr><td>9999-19</td><td>Saudi</td></tr><tr><td>9999-32</td><td>Yemeni</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
